    <decisions>
        <name>dec_01_Allowed</name>
        <label>1. Allowed</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>scr_01_NotAllowed</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>dec_01_Allowed_Yes</name>
            <conditionLogic>1 AND (2 OR 3)</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>rContract.Undo_Termination_Allowed__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Permission.cp_ContractUndoTermination</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$User.isSysAdmin__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>ass_01_TerminationDate</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Yes</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Undo the termination of a Contract (action Undo Termination on the Contract page), up to 7 days after the termination date, for users with cp_ContractUndoTermination or System Administrators.
Only sets the termination method to &quot;Termination Reverted&quot;; the rest is done by the record-triggered flows: rbb_Contract clears the termination and service end date and reactivates the contract, rau_Contract_Termination_Reverted (async) reopens the contract products with the same termination date and deletes or reverses the credit order.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>scr - Contract - Undo Termination {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>scr - Contract - Undo Termination</label>
